# Feline Sovereign (a 2/3 Cat) and Sacred Cat (a 1/1 Cat, 2/2 with "Other Cats you control get +1/+1") both connect with Bot2 in
# the same combat damage step: "one or more Cats you control deal combat damage to a player" (CR 603.2c) triggers once, so one
# artifact or enchantment Bot2 controls is destroyed, not two. The target must be Bot2's: Bot1's own Mox Pearl, and a creature of
# Bot2's are refused, while Bot2's artifact (Mox Jet), Treasure token and enchantment are all legal. Bot1 picks
# Bot2's Shapers' Sanctuary; Mox Jet and the Treasure survive.
